pes.;Musical Instrument (Drum);2g 8s 8c;2g 2s; A percussion instrument consisting of a hollow shell covered with a stretched membrane, played by striking with hands or drumsticks.;Musical Instrument (Harmonica);3g;2g 1s 4c; A small, handheld wind instrument with reed plates inside, played by blowing and drawing air through the holes.;Musical Instrument (Tabla);75g 6s 2c;59g 8s 7c; A pair of small, hand drums used in traditional Indian music, played by tapping with the fingers or palms.;Musical Instrument (Violin);28g 3s 3c;18g 9s 4c; A bowed string instrument with four strings and a curved body, used for playing classical music.;Potion of Blur;358g 8s 4c;282g 4s 5c;A clear ichor, contained in a faceted phial sealed with wax.;Potion of Cat Agility;272g 1s 2c;188g 7s 3c;Increases dexterity to 21 for 1 hour.;Potion of Cure Light Wounds;46g 7s 6c;39g 5s 5c;This smoky liquid smells like fresh bread.;Potion of Jump;35g 4s 9c;18g 7c;A glowing ichor, contained in a crystal jar etched with holy symbols.;Potion of Mage armor;43g 1s 2c;34g 9s 6c;This glowing potion causes a burning sensation when used.;Potion of Remove Fear;52g 7s 6c;42g 2s;This indigo draught causes a burning sensation when used.;Red Garnet;94g 6s 1c;89g 8s 5c;gem;Rod of the Python;13295g 2s 8c;10700g 1s 8c;This heavy rod also emits a thin ray of red light upon command. (inscription provides clue to function);Satchel of Holding;197g 9s 4c;139g 2s 1c; A small satchel enchanted with extra-dimensional space, capable of holding far more than its size suggests.;Satin Robe;207g 1s 3c;152g 7s 9c;--;Scroll of Fireball;789g 2s 5c;543g 1s 6c;This arcane scroll contains the Fireball spell, allowing its user to cast it once.;Shard of the Stars;245g 6s 5c;163g 9s 9c; A shimmering crystal shard said to contain the essence of the cosmos, capable of enhancing magical abilities.;Staff of Abjuration (16 of 50 charges);19533g 4s 2c;16948g 8s 9c;This masterwork staff is said to be imbued with thesirit of the renowned wizard Amrad, who slew the Leviathan of the Sea of Lauce. (design provides clue to function);True Wand;16424g 6s 9c;12842g 3s 3c;This wand can be used as an arcane focus. If you can castsells with an arcane focus and use this wand for yoursells, yoursells require no material components that cost less than 1000g. Additionally, when you cast asell using this wand as your arcane focus, roll an ability check with yoursellcasting ability score. If you roll higher than 11 + thesell's level, you cast thesell without using asellslot. This fails if you have nosellslots remaining of thesell's level and therefore couldn't cast without succeeding.;Whispering Wind Chime;94g 8s 9c;78g 6s 1c; A set of wind chimes that emit soothing whispers when stirred by the breeze.
